13 DSIM Cadre</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.6507%; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must possess a <strong data-end=\"116\" data-start=\"68\">Master\u2019s Degree in Statistics or Mathematics</strong> with a minimum of <strong data-end=\"171\" data-start=\"135\">55% marks in all semesters/years</strong>. For <strong data-end=\"197\" data-start=\"177\">SC/ST candidates</strong>, the minimum required marks are <strong data-end=\"237\" data-start=\"230\">50%</strong>. Check Official Notification for more details.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check : <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/crpf-tradesman-2026/\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #000000;\" target=\"_blank\">CRPF Constable Tradesman Recruitment 2026</a></span></span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0How To Check &amp; Download RBI Officer Grade-B Phase-II Admit Card 2026\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the official RBI website or the Opportunities@RBI recruitment portal.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the <strong data-end=\"201\" data-start=\"160\">\u201cRBI Officer Grade-B Admit Card 2026\u201d</strong>\u00a0/\u00a0<strong data-end=\"221\" data-start=\"204\">\u201cCall Letter\u201d</strong>\u00a0link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Enter your <strong data-end=\"280\" data-start=\"243\">Registration Number / Roll Number</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong data-end=\"313\" data-start=\"285\">Password / Date of Birth</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Fill in the Captcha Code displayed on the screen.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the <strong data-end=\"404\" data-start=\"386\">Login / Submit</strong>\u00a0button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Your <strong>RBI Grade-B Admit Card 2026</strong> will appear on the screen.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download the <strong>Admit Card PDF and save</strong> it for future use.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\u00a0RBI Officer Grade-B Recruitment 2026 : </span>Mode Of Selection\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Online Examination (CBT)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Language Proficiency Test (LPT)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Final Merit List</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our WhatsApp Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"c